{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026adATJWVGgW1794956814.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>據報美國人工智能(AI)公司Anthropic新股定價處於指引區間上限或以上。</p><p></p><p>《CNBC》引述知情人士透露，Anthropic向潛在投資者傳達預期，公司股票擬定於價格範圍上限，甚至可能更高。根據提交予美國證交會的文件，Anthropic計劃共發售8.25億股，發行價範圍為每股70至78美元。按此價格計算，加上260億美元的私募融資，今次IPO共籌集904億美元。</p><p></p><p>知情人士表示，承銷銀行預計將於紐約時間周二下午4點停止接受認購。若按價格區間上限計算，Anthropic完全稀釋估值約1.4萬億美元。相關討論仍在進行中，發行細節仍有可能發生變化。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T00:02:45.854726+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":274,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T22:46:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T02:48:11.703315+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T23:56:01.300657+00:00","content_hash":"4182ece1071289e11e9fa1ff5458de280888374fca6ef97dc6b5bc124f4de828","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T00:02:45.854726+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}